{
  "_note": "Snapshot of the pi-arm2 (Raspberry Pi) machine config, 2026-10-23, after leader/follower calibration and teleop setup. The ViamShellDanger fragment (b511adfa-80ab-4a70-9bd5-fbb14696b17e) was also imported. No secrets are stored here.",
  "components": [
